// cross-end-behavior-waivers.jsonl —— 跨端共享屏「行为型 prop 单端缺席」的**在册容忍台账**。
// 一行一条 JSON:{screen, prop, side, reason, owner, expires, evidence}。
// side = 缺席端(rn|mini);evidence = 仓库内 文件:行,至少 2 条且必须覆盖双端,
// 其中至少 1 条落在 packages/types/src 的声明行并真含 prop 名(防拿两枚无关行凑数)。
// 判据 = scripts/tests/cross-end-behavior-waivers.test.mjs(结构/过期/证据三件套)。
// 与门 288 的 scripts/data/cross-end-props-judged.json 刻意分账:门 288 只对**同名组件对**判键集,
// 且其口径为「平台差异不挂账、条目上限恒为 0」;本台账记的是**屏幕级**行为槽位缺席,不在门 288 的取材面内。
// 口径:未登记在本台账的单端缺席 = 待补传/待扩契约,不得静默容忍;登记项若在任一端补成真消费,
// 必须同轮删除本行(过期的容忍会吞掉新缺口)。
// expires 必填(YYYY-MM-DD),到期即回到未裁队列;owner 为承接该差异的常设工作流,非个人。
// 本批凭据来源:2026-11-06 三端调用点逐条核对(共享屏 JSX 传参面 × packages/types 声明面)。
{"screen":"MessageCenterScreen","prop":"onPressItem","side":"mini","reason":"小程序消息页只有 getRooms 聚合会话数据源,没有消息卡片(items)列表,点击卡片在本端无承载对象;共享屏不传该 prop 时卡片默认可点性不渲染,故按平台数据模型差异容忍,不造卡片回调。","owner":"ihui-cross-end","expires":"2027-06-30","evidence":["packages/types/src/app-message.ts:64","apps/mobile-rn/src/screens/MessageCenterScreen.tsx:289","apps/miniapp-taro/src/pkg-user/message/index.tsx:502"]}
{"screen":"MessageCenterScreen","prop":"onTogglePin","side":"mini","reason":"小程序会话由 getRooms 聚合而来,接口与本地状态均无置顶字段,也没有置顶/取消置顶动作;补传只能得到一个永远无效的按钮,故不传。","owner":"ihui-cross-end","expires":"2027-06-30","evidence":["packages/types/src/app-message.ts:71","apps/mobile-rn/src/screens/MessageCenterScreen.tsx:294","apps/miniapp-taro/src/pkg-user/message/index.tsx:502"]}
{"screen":"MessageCenterScreen","prop":"hasMore","side":"mini","reason":"小程序 getRooms 一次返回全集且无分页参数,不存在下一页;hasMore 只驱动「加载更多」入口,本端不传即不渲染,属数据面能力差异而非行为漏传。","owner":"ihui-cross-end","expires":"2027-06-30","evidence":["packages/types/src/app-message.ts:95","apps/mobile-rn/src/screens/MessageCenterScreen.tsx:305","apps/miniapp-taro/src/pkg-user/message/index.tsx:502"]}
{"screen":"MessageCenterScreen","prop":"loadingMore","side":"mini","reason":"与 hasMore 同源:小程序会话聚合接口没有分页请求,不存在加载中态;传常量 false 属于伪造状态,故保持不传并由共享屏默认隐藏底部入口。","owner":"ihui-cross-end","expires":"2027-06-30","evidence":["packages/types/src/app-message.ts:97","apps/mobile-rn/src/screens/MessageCenterScreen.tsx:306","apps/miniapp-taro/src/pkg-user/message/index.tsx:502"]}
{"screen":"MessageCenterScreen","prop":"onLoadMore","side":"mini","reason":"小程序会话聚合接口不支持 offset/limit,没有加载更多语义;共享屏不传该回调即隐藏底部入口,现有列表展示不受影响,补传会引入无接口支撑的假分页。","owner":"ihui-cross-end","expires":"2027-06-30","evidence":["packages/types/src/app-message.ts:99","apps/mobile-rn/src/screens/MessageCenterScreen.tsx:307","apps/miniapp-taro/src/pkg-user/message/index.tsx:502"]}
{"screen":"MessageCenterScreen","prop":"renderTabBody","side":"rn","reason":"RN 复用共享屏默认 tab 体(消息卡片 items 列表),小程序因只有聚合会话而注入自定义 tab 体;两端数据形状不同,统一注入体需重写 RN 列表语义,按平台注入差异容忍,不强行同构。","owner":"ihui-cross-end","expires":"2027-06-30","evidence":["packages/types/src/app-message.ts:93","apps/mobile-rn/src/screens/MessageCenterScreen.tsx:277","apps/miniapp-taro/src/pkg-user/message/index.tsx:533"]}
{"screen":"ChangePwdScreen","prop":"onForgotOld","side":"rn","reason":"RN 无 forgot-password 页/路由,无法跳转修改原密码;共享屏不传该回调即不渲染「忘记原密码」入口,禁止为对齐补一条死链,故按端能力缺失容忍。","owner":"ihui-cross-end","expires":"2027-06-30","evidence":["packages/types/src/app-account.ts:495","apps/mobile-rn/src/screens/ChangePwdScreen.tsx:69","apps/mobile-rn/src/navigation/RootNavigator.tsx:1299","apps/miniapp-taro/src/pkg-user/user/password.tsx:115"]}
{"screen":"LecturerDetailScreen","prop":"onViewCourses","side":"rn","reason":"RN 无按讲师筛选的课程列表(CourseFilter 不接受讲师参数,MoreCourse 是通用更多课),拒绝造假入口。本条固定写入台账,防止以后有人顺手补一个假入口。","owner":"ihui-cross-end","expires":"2027-06-30","evidence":["packages/types/src/app-learning.ts:661","apps/mobile-rn/src/screens/TeacherDetailScreen.tsx:135","apps/mobile-rn/src/navigation/RootNavigator.tsx:462","apps/miniapp-taro/src/pkg-learn/teacher/detail.tsx:180"]}
{"screen":"CouponScreen","prop":"onUseCoupon","side":"rn","reason":"RN 无承接用券的商城/商品路由,且 mobile-rn 词包无 coupon.useHint,禁止新增词条;共享屏不传时「立即使用」不渲染,按产品级缺失容忍,不以 toast 占位冒充功能。","owner":"ihui-cross-end","expires":"2027-06-30","evidence":["packages/types/src/app-commerce.ts:309","apps/mobile-rn/src/screens/CouponScreen.tsx:89","apps/mobile-rn/src/i18n/index.tsx:25","apps/miniapp-taro/src/pages/member/coupon.tsx:105"]}
